# ==========================================
# RELAY STATION: STEALTH CLOAK
# Mengabaikan file data dan media rahasia
# ==========================================

# Abaikan folder memori & media
#
# NOTE: this must be /data/* and NOT /data/ . Git does not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a negation for a file inside it can never match -
# which silently left data/.htaccess untracked and a fresh clone with no
# protection for the database it is about to create. Excluding the CONTENTS
# instead lets the negation below take effect.
/data/*
/media/*

# Abaikan file arsip installer & OTA
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The access rules inside data/ MUST be tracked. The directory's
# runtime contents stay ignored; only the rules travel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
!/data/.htaccess

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The installer kit ships in the release, but the archive it unpacks
# (relay.zip) is a build artifact, not source - it is generated from
# the application tree when a release is cut.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/installer/relay.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# STAGING - NOT SOURCE. Do not commit these.
#
# Recovered from git history and parked in the root so the operator
# can copy them out to the Lighthouse (hub) server. They are NOT part
# of a node: api_register.php and api_directory.php are the hub's
# public, unauthenticated endpoints, and index.html is the hub's
# landing page. Committing them would undo the node/hub split.
#
# This block is a local safeguard so `git add -A` cannot sweep them
# into the v8.0 tag by accident. Remove it once the files have been
# collected, or move them into the relay-lighthouse repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/api_register.php
/api_directory.php
/setup_lighthouse.php
/lighthouse_config.example.php
/index.html
